# Keyword memory

Past chats are one line each in `.cursor/memory/KEYWORDS.md`: `keywords | date | fact | chat`.
When `<mem>` is already in the prompt, use those lines and do not open the file.
When it is absent, grep that file for 2–4 rare words from the question and use only the matching lines.
Do not open agent transcripts or read the memory file from top to bottom.
Hooks record each turn. Rewrite a line only when asked to correct a fact.
